HHIISSTTOORRYY
     OpenBSD support for nneepp first appeared in OpenBSD 5.7.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The nneepp driver was written by Mark Kettenis <_k_e_t_t_e_n_i_s_@_o_p_e_n_b_s_d_._o_r_g>.

BBUUGGSS
     The nneepp driver currently only supports 1Gb Ethernet NICs.  It also does
     not yet use many of the advanced features the Neptune chip offers.

